<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:10:29 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“没有回答重大问题”：尽管周一股市上涨，但股市仍比人工智能推动的峰值低 5 万亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/wall-street-ai-stock-market-selloff-8-trillion-loss-nvidia-jensen-huang-return-anthropic-ipo-memory-chips-rebound/</link><description>华尔街自 2025 年 4 月以来最好的一天——以及黄仁勋的复活——仍然让人工智能交易陷入困境。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2301014104_491794-e1795469835258.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:44:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/wall-street-ai-stock-market-selloff-8-trillion-loss-nvidia-jensen-huang-return-anthropic-ipo-memory-chips-rebound/</guid></item><item><title>黄仁勋的回归是硅谷想要的——但情况不一定会一样</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/jensen-huangs-return-is-what-silicon-valley-wanted-but-things-wont-necessarily-be-the-same/</link><description>黄仁勋与一名涉嫌中国间谍的恋情导致他被英伟达开除。 11 天后，他回来了——这是硅谷创始人、观察家和名人一直想要的结果。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2298610171-e1795473056383.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:31:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/jensen-huangs-return-is-what-silicon-valley-wanted-but-things-wont-necessarily-be-the-same/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能初创公司担心，如果没有黄仁勋，英伟达的资金就会枯竭。他重新担任首席执行官消除了这些担忧</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/nvidia-jensen-huang-return-ai-startups-neoclouds-funding/</link><description>近两周来，投资者担心英伟达的投资和信贷支持可能会在临时首席执行官的领导下陷入停滞。黄的回归平息了这些担忧。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2299100584-e1794504561328.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:21:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/nvidia-jensen-huang-return-ai-startups-neoclouds-funding/</guid></item><item><title>随着黄仁勋重新担任首席执行官，Nvidia 的 SEC 调查使 CFO Colette Kress 成为人们关注的焦点</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/with-jensen-huang-back-ceo-nvidias-sec-probe-puts-cfo-colette-kress-in-spotlight/</link><description>克雷斯在短暂担任临时首席执行官后仍担任财务总监，但有关英伟达会计的问题仍然存在。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305083085_208786.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:14:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/with-jensen-huang-back-ceo-nvidias-sec-probe-puts-cfo-colette-kress-in-spotlight/</guid></item><item><title>“自愿、可撤销”：Anthropic 创始人 1120 亿美元捐赠承诺背后的细则</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/anthropic-ipo-charity-pledges-stock-price/</link><description>股票基金、高达 3 比 1 的员工匹配以及 80% 的创始人承诺意味着 Anthropic 的捐赠金额与其股价相当。这是每个人的立场。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305300345.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:49:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/anthropic-ipo-charity-pledges-stock-price/</guid></item><item><title>德桑蒂斯表示，佛罗里达州的一座城市误读了他的反 DEI 法律。现在，一家非营利组织需要 13 万美元来挽救其圣帕特里克节游行</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/floridas-anti-dei-law-st-patricks-day-delray/</link><description>一项旨在限制 DEI 倡议的法律现在被引用为终止德尔雷比奇对其已有数十年历史的圣帕特里克节游行的赞助的理由。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2266541346-e1795469201308.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:36:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/floridas-anti-dei-law-st-patricks-day-delray/</guid></item><item><title>亿万富翁花费 3.78 亿美元推翻 40 号提案。挪威已有 134 年历史的财富税提供了不同的模式</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/norway-wealth-tax-us-billionaire-tax-prop-40/</link><description>挪威征收 1% 的税，惠及中产阶级并筹集少量资金。美国计划将 938 名亿万富翁的税率定为 5%，这将招致逃亡和法庭诉讼。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305437556.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:23:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/norway-wealth-tax-us-billionaire-tax-prop-40/</guid></item><item><title>“超级智能即将到来”：马克·扎克伯格的人工智能负责人警告说，随着人工智能泡沫拒绝破裂，人类可能会失去控制</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/alexandr-wang-meta-superintelligence-arriving-riemann-hypothesis-nasdaq-ai-selloff/</link><description>Meta 的人工智能负责人表示，与黎曼猜想相比，原子弹是“一个家庭作业问题”，一位人择数学家称他与克劳德一起破解了黎曼猜想。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2296214013.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:35:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/alexandr-wang-meta-superintelligence-arriving-riemann-hypothesis-nasdaq-ai-selloff/</guid></item><item><title>分析师警告说，人工智能的崩溃对中国经济构成越来越大的威胁，对习近平主席来说也是“真正的危险时刻”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/ai-bust-china-economy-xi-jinping-property-crash-stock-market/</link><description>“为了保持人工智能资金的流动，习近平需要一个活跃的股市。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305267967-e1795290326772.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:45:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/ai-bust-china-economy-xi-jinping-property-crash-stock-market/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普向英伟达董事会就国家安全做出的“保证”：免受主要法律危险源的影响？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/trump-assurance-to-nvidia-board-over-national-security-legal-threats/</link><description>白宫发言人向《财富》杂志证实了特朗普的角色：“特朗普总统完全参与其中……我们必须保护我们的天才。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2297774940_c2183f-e1795467728359.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:25:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/trump-assurance-to-nvidia-board-over-national-security-legal-threats/</guid></item></channel></rss>